{"id": "Tdc9wzMjl1td", "owner": "showcase", "title": "TOP HOODS — Token Holder Leaderboard", "createdAt": 1790349579174, "updatedAt": 1790349706433, "versions": [{"prompt": "Token holder leaderboard \"Top Hoods\" — podium for top 3 with glowing ranks, ranked table with wallet addresses and badges, rewards panel. Visual theme (follow strictly): near-black background (#050b09), neon green #39ff14 and electric blue #5bd1ff as the ONLY accent colors, subtle pixel-grid / scanline texture, glowing edges and soft neon bloom, bold grotesk headings with monospace details, futuristic cyber-crypto aesthetic. Desktop 1440px wide, fill the first screen with the hero.", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>TOP HOODS — Token Holder Leaderboard</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root{\n  --bg:#070b05;\n  --bg2:#0a1107;\n  --green:#ffda14;\n  --blue:#5bff89;\n  --ink:#e6f5d7;\n  --mute:#7b8c6f;\n  --line:rgba(255,218,20,.16);\n  --line2:rgba(91,255,137,.18);\n  --max:1440px;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0}\nbody{\n  background:var(--bg);\n  color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:'Space Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n  overflow-x:hidden;\n}\n/* ---------- texture layers ---------- */\n.fx{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:60}\n.fx.grid{\n  z-index:0;\n  background-image:\n    linear-gradient(rgba(255,218,20,.055) 1px,transparent 1px),\n    linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,218,20,.055) 1px,transparent 1px);\n  background-size:40px 40px;\n  mask-image:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 0%,#000000 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.35) 55%,transparent 95%);\n}\n.fx.pix{\n  z-index:0;opacity:.5;\n  background-image:\n    linear-gradient(rgba(91,255,137,.05) 1px,transparent 1px),\n    linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(91,255,137,.05) 1px,transparent 1px);\n  background-size:8px 8px;\n  mask-image:radial-gradient(80% 60% at 50% 15%,#000000,transparent 80%);\n}\n.fx.scan{\n  background:repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(0,0,0,0) 0 2px,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 2px 4px);\n  opacity:.5;mix-blend-mode:multiply;\n}\n.fx.sweep{\n  background:linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent,rgba(255,218,20,.07),transparent);\n  height:180px;animation:sweep 9s linear infinite;inset:auto 0 auto 0;\n}\n@keyframes sweep{0%{transform:translateY(-200px)}100%{transform:translateY(110vh)}}\n.fx.vig{background:radial-gradient(130% 100% at 50% 40%,transparent 40%,rgba(0,0,0,.75) 100%)}\n.wrap{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n@media(max-width:760px){.wrap{padding:0 18px}}\n\n/* ---------- typography ---------- */\nh1,h2,h3{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:.95;margin:0}\n.mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n.kicker{\n  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.34em;\n  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);\n}\n.dim{color:var(--mute)}\n.blue{color:var(--blue)}\n.glow-g{text-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(255,218,20,.55),0 0 42px rgba(255,218,20,.22)}\n.glow-b{text-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(91,255,137,.6),0 0 42px rgba(91,255,137,.25)}\n\n/* ---------- nav ---------- */\nheader{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40;backdrop-filter:blur(12px);\n  background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(7,11,5,.94),rgba(7,11,5,.62));\n  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px;height:72px}\n.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-size:17px}\n.brand svg{filter:drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(255,218,20,.75))}\nnav.links{display:flex;gap:28px;margin-left:auto}\nnav.links a{color:var(--mute);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:.2s}\nnav.links a:hover,nav.links a[aria-current]{color:var(--green);text-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(255,218,20,.6)}\n.btn{\n  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:2px;\n  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;\n  border:1px solid var(--green);color:#0d1004;background:var(--green);cursor:pointer;\n  box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(255,218,20,.4),inset 0 0 12px rgba(255,255,255,.25);\n  text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;transition:.18s;\n}\n.btn:hover{box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(255,218,20,.75);transform:translateY(-1px)}\n.btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--blue);border-color:rgba(91,255,137,.5);box-shadow:none}\n.btn.ghost:hover{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(91,255,137,.3)}\n@media(max-width:900px){nav.links{display:none}}\n\n/* ---------- hero ---------- */\n.hero{min-height:calc(100vh - 72px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:44px 0 56px;position:relative}\n.hero-top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:48px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:46px}\n.hero h1{font-size:clamp(46px,7.4vw,108px);letter-spacing:-.045em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--green);}\n.hero p.lead{max-width:44ch;color:#adc09f;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;margin:20px 0 0}\n.ticker{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px}\n.chip{border:1px solid var(--line2);color:var(--blue);padding:6px 11px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;background:rgba(91,255,137,.05)}\n.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line)}\n.stat{background:var(--bg2);padding:18px 16px}\n.stat b{display:block;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:var(--green);letter-spacing:-.02em}\n.stat span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mute);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}\n@media(max-width:980px){.hero-top{grid-template-columns:1fr;align-items:start;gap:28px}}\n\n/* ---------- podium ---------- */\n.podium{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.18fr 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:end}\n.pod{\n  position:relative;border:1px solid var(--line);background:\n    linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,218,20,.06),rgba(7,11,5,.2) 40%),var(--bg2);\n  padding:24px 22px 22px;overflow:hidden;\n}\n.pod::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:\n  repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(0,0,0,0) 0 3px,rgba(0,0,0,.25) 3px 4px);opacity:.35;pointer-events:none}\n.pod .rank{\n  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;line-height:.8;letter-spacing:-.05em;\n  font-size:76px;color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px var(--blue);\n  text-shadow:0 0 26px rgba(91,255,137,.45);\n}\n.pod.first{padding:34px 26px 30px;border-color:rgba(255,218,20,.5);\n  box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,218,20,.12),0 0 60px rgba(255,218,20,.18),inset 0 0 60px rgba(255,218,20,.06)}\n.pod.first .rank{font-size:104px;-webkit-text-stroke:2px var(--green);text-shadow:0 0 34px rgba(255,218,20,.6);animation:pulse 3.4s ease-in-out infinite}\n@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.72}}\n.pod .crown{position:absolute;right:22px;top:22px;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(255,218,20,.7))}\n.ava{width:54px;height:54px;border:1px solid var(--line2);margin:18px 0 14px;position:relative;background:#081004}\n.pod .name{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em}\n.pod.first .name{font-size:28px}\n.pod .addr{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--blue);margin-top:6px;letter-spacing:.04em}\n.pod .amt{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;margin-top:18px;color:var(--ink)}\n.pod.first .amt{font-size:34px;color:var(--green);text-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(255,218,20,.5)}\n.pod .amt small{font-size:12px;color:var(--mute);font-weight:400;margin-left:6px}\n.bar{height:4px;background:rgba(255,218,20,.12);margin-top:14px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.bar i{position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue),var(--green));box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(255,218,20,.6);animation:grow 1.4s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) both}\n@keyframes grow{from{width:0!important}}\n.pod .meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--mute);letter-spacing:.08em}\n.pod .meta b{color:var(--green);font-weight:500}\n.plinth{height:var(--h);margin-top:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:none;\n  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,218,20,.1),transparent);\n  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.3em;color:var(--mute)}\n@media(max-width:980px){.podium{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}.plinth{display:none}.pod.first{order:-1}}\n\n/* ---------- section head ---------- */\nsection.block{padding:96px 0 0}\n.shead{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;margin-bottom:26px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:18px}\n.shead h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,46px);text-transform:uppercase}\n.tabs{display:flex;gap:6px}\n.tab{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--mute);padding:8px 14px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;transition:.18s}\n.tab:hover{color:var(--ink)}\n.tab.on{color:#0d1004;background:var(--green);border-color:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(255,218,20,.4);font-weight:700}\n\n/* ---------- table ---------- */\n.tablewrap{border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(10,17,7,.75);overflow-x:auto}\ntable{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:860px}\nthead th{\n  text-align:left;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;\n  color:var(--mute);padding:14px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:500;background:rgba(255,218,20,.03)\n}\ntbody td{padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,218,20,.07);font-size:14px;vertical-align:middle}\ntbody tr{transition:.16s}\ntbody tr:hover{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,218,20,.08),rgba(91,255,137,.04));box-shadow:inset 3px 0 0 var(--green)}\ntd.rk{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--blue);width:70px}\n.holder{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\n.dot{width:30px;height:30px;flex:none;border:1px solid var(--line2)}\n.holder b{display:block;font-size:14.5px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.holder span{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--mute)}\n.badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:4px 9px;border:1px solid var(--line2);color:var(--blue);\n  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;background:rgba(91,255,137,.06)}\n.badge.g{border-color:rgba(255,218,20,.35);color:var(--green);background:rgba(255,218,20,.06)}\n.num{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-weight:500}\n.up{color:var(--green)}.down{color:var(--blue);opacity:.8}\n.minibar{width:92px;height:3px;background:rgba(91,255,137,.15);position:relative}\n.minibar i{position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(255,218,20,.7)}\n.tfoot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:16px 20px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--mute);letter-spacing:.1em}\n\n/* ---------- rewards ---------- */\n.rewards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .9fr;gap:20px}\n.panel{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--bg2);padding:28px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.panel.blue{border-color:var(--line2)}\n.panel::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;width:280px;height:280px;right:-120px;top:-120px;border-radius:50%;\n  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,218,20,.18),transparent 70%);pointer-events:none}\n.panel.blue::after{background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(91,255,137,.18),transparent 70%)}\n.pool{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,64px);font-weight:700;color:var(--green);letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1;margin:14px 0 6px}\n.tiers{margin-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.tier{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;gap:16px;align-items:center;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,218,20,.08)}\n.tier .t{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--blue);width:90px}\n.tier .share{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink)}\n.tier .g{height:6px;background:rgba(91,255,137,.12);position:relative}\n.tier .g i{position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--green),var(--blue));box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(255,218,20,.4)}\n.cd{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;margin:18px 0 22px}\n.cd div{border:1px solid var(--line2);padding:12px 6px;text-align:center;background:rgba(91,255,137,.04)}\n.cd b{display:block;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:26px;color:var(--blue);line-height:1;text-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(91,255,137,.5)}\n.cd span{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--mute);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;text-transform:uppercase}\n.rowline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(91,255,137,.1);font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px}\n.rowline span{color:var(--mute)}\n@media(max-width:980px){.rewards{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n\n/* ---------- footer ---------- */\nfooter{margin-top:96px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:34px 0 46px}\n.fgrid{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--mute);letter-spacing:.1em}\n.fgrid a{color:var(--mute);text-decoration:none}\n.fgrid a:hover{color:var(--green)}\n.blink{animation:blink 1.1s steps(2,end) infinite}\n@keyframes blink{50%{opacity:0}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!--tr-cover-->\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n.trc{--a:#ffc83d;position:relative;z-index:1000;height:100vh;min-height:620px;overflow:hidden;background:#000;color:#fff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;isolation:isolate}\n.trc-s{position:absolute;inset:-4%;background-size:cover;background-position:center;opacity:0;transition:opacity 1.4s ease;animation:trcKen 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate}\n.trc-s.on{opacity:1}\n@keyframes trcKen{from{transform:scale(1) translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:scale(1.09) translate3d(-1.5%,-1%,0)}}\n.trc::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.55) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 22%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 48%,rgba(0,0,0,.82) 100%)}\n.trc-nav{position:absolute;z-index:3;top:18px;left:24px;right:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;padding:10px 12px 10px 16px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(10,10,12,.42);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}\n.trc-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.01em;white-space:nowrap}\n.trc-logo i{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--a);box-shadow:0 0 22px var(--a);display:grid;place-items:center;font-style:normal;color:#000;font-size:13px;font-weight:900}\n.trc-links{display:flex;gap:22px;flex:1}\n.trc-links a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);text-decoration:none;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500}\n.trc-links a:hover{color:#fff}\n.trc-btn{height:38px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#fff;font:600 13px Inter,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n.trc-btn.pri{background:var(--a);border-color:var(--a);color:#000;box-shadow:0 8px 28px -8px var(--a)}\n.trc-copy{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:48px;right:48px;bottom:56px;max-width:880px}\n.trc-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.trc-chip b{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--a)}\n.trc h1{font-family:\"Playfair Display\",Inter,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(44px,9vw,150px);line-height:.9;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:18px 0 14px;text-shadow:0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}\n.trc h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--a)}\n.trc p{font-size:clamp(16px,1.6vw,20px);line-height:1.45;color:rgba(255,255,255,.86);max-width:560px;margin:0 0 24px}\n.trc-ctas{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.trc-ctas .trc-btn{height:48px;padding:0 22px;font-size:14.5px;border-radius:12px}\n.trc-dots{position:absolute;z-index:3;right:48px;bottom:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:600 12px Inter,sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75)}\n.trc-dots i{width:22px;height:3px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);transition:.4s}\n.trc-dots i.on{width:44px;background:var(--a)}\n.trc-dots span{margin-left:8px;letter-spacing:.08em}\n@media(max-width:760px){.trc-links{display:none}.trc-nav{left:12px;right:12px;gap:10px;justify-content:space-between}.trc-nav .trc-btn:not(.pri){display:none}.trc-copy{left:20px;right:20px;bottom:40px}.trc-dots{display:none}}\n</style>\n<section class=\"trc\" data-trc=\"leaderboard\">\n  <div class=\"trc-s on\" style=\"background-image:url(/img/cover/awesome-creative-coding.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"trc-s\" style=\"background-image:url(/img/cover/show-4.jpg)\"></div>\n  <nav class=\"trc-nav\"><div class=\"trc-logo\"><i>T</i>Top Hoods</div><div class=\"trc-links\"><a href=\"#\">Rankings</a><a href=\"#\">Rewards</a><a href=\"#\">Seasons</a><a href=\"#\">Rules</a></div><button class=\"trc-btn\">Sign in</button><button class=\"trc-btn pri\">Check my rank</button></nav>\n  <div class=\"trc-copy\"><span class=\"trc-chip\"><b></b>Holder leaderboard · Robinhood Chain</span><h1>Top <em>Hoods</em></h1><p>Hold like royalty. The biggest hoods on the chain, ranked live.</p>\n    <div class=\"trc-ctas\"><button class=\"trc-btn pri\">Check my rank</button><button class=\"trc-btn\">Learn more</button></div></div>\n  <div class=\"trc-dots\"><i class=on></i><i></i><span>01 / 02</span></div>\n</section>\n<script>(function(){var r=document.querySelector('[data-trc]'),s=r.querySelectorAll('.trc-s'),d=r.querySelectorAll('.trc-dots i'),n=r.querySelector('.trc-dots span'),k=0;\nfunction go(i){k=i%s.length;s.forEach(function(e,j){e.classList.toggle('on',j===k)});d.forEach(function(e,j){e.classList.toggle('on',j===k)});if(n)n.textContent='0'+(k+1)+' / 0'+s.length}\nvar h=/#s(\\d)/.exec(location.hash);if(h)go(+h[1]-1);else if(s.length>1)setInterval(function(){go(k+1)},5200);}());</script>\n<!--/tr-cover-->\n\n\n\n<div class=\"fx grid\"></div><div class=\"fx pix\"></div>\n<div class=\"fx scan\"></div><div class=\"fx sweep\"></div><div class=\"fx vig\"></div>\n\n<header>\n  <div class=\"wrap nav\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 26\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M13 1 24 7v12L13 25 2 19V7z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffda14\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n        <path d=\"M13 7l6 3.3v6.6L13 20l-6-3.1v-6.6z\" fill=\"#ffda14\" opacity=\".2\"/>\n        <path d=\"M13 7v13\" stroke=\"#5bff89\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n      </svg>\n      TOP&nbsp;HOODS\n    </div>\n    <nav class=\"links\">\n      <a href=\"#leaderboard\" aria-current=\"page\">